  "description": "Yoon-jae, a pure-minded dreamer who wants to have a proper relationship. Because he doesn't eat regularly, he reluctantly finds a one-night partner at the bar. I had a satisfying night with the man I met at the bar, Hyeonu, but I  \nrefused the offer to keep in touch and came back home to attend the class opening party...\n\nClub man, why are you here?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_dalkomm_wz), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/plz_sweet_dream)",
